    {
      "id": "claim_fb5b2c59c8354de28a6286d6ad0b4d47",
      "statement": "Re-exporting an FBX to the same path preserves its GUID through the surviving .meta but churns the internal file IDs of every bone Transform and AnimationClip, breaking each reference into the model and surfacing only as a skeleton that can no longer resolve its root.",
